  A translation of HOL Light's `Multivariate/metric.ml`, in the style of
  HolMultiLib/Determinants.lean: pure, the proofs translated by hand, one
  `let` per OCaml `let`, in file order.  What metric.ml uses from the core
  library, from Multivariate/misc.ml and from Library/products.ml, iter.ml
  (and card.ml, floor.ml, wo.ml, which misc.ml loads) is passed in
  `MetricDeps`; SessionMultiLib/Metric.lean supplies it.

  Like the rest of HolMultiLib this module's C is compiled at -O0 (see
  lakefile.lean): it is one-off theorem set-up in very large functions.
-/

